#: src/pages/settings/applications/utils/getCustomApplicationDescription.ts
#. js-lingui-id: WOXdI6
msgid ""
"Host your workspace's customizations and overrides.\n"
"\n"
"#### What it includes\n"
"Every extension you create on top of the standard app is grouped under Custom. It keeps your schema changes, interface changes, and workspace-specific logic in one place.\n"
"\n"
"- Custom objects and fields for your own data model\n"
"- Views, navigation items, and record layouts that shape how your team works\n"
"- Logic functions, front components, and agents that automate or extend the workspace\n"
"\n"
"#### Why it exists\n"
"Use this app for workspace-specific customization that should stay local to this workspace.\n"
"\n"
"If you are shaping one workspace for one business, keep it here. If you are building a reusable business app with its own data model, UI, and automation that should be versioned, shared, or installed across workspaces, create a dedicated app instead.\n"
"\n"
"#### Build your own app\n"
"\n"
"Scaffold a new app in one command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the [Getting Started guide](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/getting-started) for the full walkthrough, and [Building Apps](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/building) for the `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` APIs."
msgstr ""
"Huisves jou werkruimte se aanpassings en oorskrywings.\n"
"\n"
"#### Wat dit insluit\n"
"Elke uitbreiding wat jy bo-op die standaardtoepassing skep, word onder Custom gegroepeer. Dit hou jou skemaveranderings, koppelvlakveranderings en werkruimte-spesifieke logika op een plek.\n"
"\n"
"- Pasgemaakte objekte en velde vir jou eie datamodel\n"
"- Aansigte, navigasie-items en rekorduitlegte wat bepaal hoe jou span werk\n"
"- Logikafunksies, front-end-komponente en agente wat die werkruimte outomatiseer of uitbrei\n"
"\n"
"#### Waarom dit bestaan\n"
"Gebruik hierdie toepassing vir werkruimte-spesifieke aanpassing wat plaaslik tot hierdie werkruimte moet bly.\n"
"\n"
"As jy een werkruimte vir een besigheid vorm, hou dit hier. As jy 'n herbruikbare besigheidstoepassing bou met sy eie datamodel, UI en outomatisering wat weergawebeheer moet hê, gedeel of oor werkruimtes geïnstalleer moet word, skep eerder 'n toegewyde toepassing.\n"
"\n"
"#### Bou jou eie toepassing\n"
"\n"
"Skep 'n nuwe toepassing met een opdrag:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Sien die [Aan die gang-gids](https://app.closeai.pt) vir die volledige stap-vir-stapgids, en [Bou toepassings](https://app.closeai.pt) vir die `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` API's."

